# 1. Objective

Investigate what must be changed in `nrna1` to evolve it into the following target architecture:

```text
                    PUBLICDIGIT PLATFORM
                           │
                           ▼
                 Central / Platform DB
                           │
              ┌────────────┼────────────┐
              │            │            │
              ▼            ▼            ▼
          NRNA tenant   NC tenant    CPN-UML tenant
              DB           DB            DB
              │            │             │
              ▼            ▼             ▼
nrna.publicdigit.com  nc.publicdigit.com  cpnuml.publicdigit.com
```

Additional organisations may include:

```text
nrnagermany.publicdigit.com
<other-org>.publicdigit.com
```

The architectural rule is:

> **One organisation = one tenant = one organisation-specific hostname = one physical PostgreSQL database.**

Examples:

```text
nrna.publicdigit.com
    → NRNA organisation
    → NRNA tenant database

nc.publicdigit.com
    → NC organisation
    → NC tenant database

cpnuml.publicdigit.com
    → CPN-UML organisation
    → CPN-UML tenant database

nrnagermany.publicdigit.com
    → NRNA Germany organisation
    → NRNA Germany tenant database
```

The investigation must determine the **minimum safe architectural change** required to achieve this.

Do NOT implement anything yet.

