# 2. Critical architectural principle

Do NOT treat the hostname as the database name.

Instead, the desired resolution is:

```text
HTTP Host
    │
    ▼
Organisation / Tenant Registry
    │
    ├── organisation_id
    ├── slug
    ├── hostname
    ├── status
    └── database configuration/reference
    │
    ▼
TenantContext
    │
    ▼
TenantDatabaseResolver
    │
    ▼
Tenant PostgreSQL connection
```

For example:

```text
nrna.publicdigit.com
        │
        ▼
Organisation: NRNA
        │
        ▼
Tenant DB configuration
        │
        ▼
NRNA PostgreSQL database
```

The hostname is therefore a **tenant identity/routing key**, not a physical database identifier.

